# armour/<body>/skirt_hauberk: HAUBERK, a straight mail skirt in metal-2 courses (N between) with a front
# slit, on a body that is not mail (a mail torso draws its own knee skirt: the base views are empty); its
# lower courses hang behind the legs to mid-shin (skirt_hauberk_back), a straight column to 1x.
# Generated from the FORGE-LIMBS skirt templates (gen_skirts2.py, skirts_def.py; iteration 2: the D view serves U, `tags anyfacing`); Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (FORGE-LIMBS envelope r1) T5-T6 skirt flare (STYLE_P2 29.3): `armour.t5` views facing D/U, 1 px more past the hips on the lower half; flared copies of the replace views go before them. Generated by FORGE-LIMBS flare.py.
# (ARMOUR-W wave 2 r4) D sit / D floor (every variant) = the kneel lap view, as skirt_bell and skirt_split: a seated woman keeps her skirt (B6 postures on v1).
use person
body woman
role overlay skirt.hauberk
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
tags anyfacing
z 10

view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view D key rest origin 9 0 when !form-mail,armour.t5 replace
|..vyzyyyyyxxwwwv..
|..vxxxxxwwwwwwwv..
|..vwwwwvvvwwwwvv..
|.vyyyxwv..vyyxwwv.
|.vyyxxwv..vyxxwwv.
|.vvvvvvv..vvvvvvv.
regions
|..................
|..................
|...NNNNN..NNNNN...
|..................
|..RRRRR....RRRRR..
|..................

